        scenario: `The reserving actuary wants the standard view: accident years down, development lags across, the latest diagonal, the selected development factor applied forward, and the resulting IBNR per row. The chain-ladder computation is done for you in the numbers below \u2014 your job is the table and its derived columns.`,
